>>> Thanks for this great KIP. Some comments.
>>>=20
>>> AS1: A limitation of this KIP is that it will not support classic =
consumer groups. I think this is not a problem and it will be a =
motivator for users to adopt modern consumer groups, but it will be =
necessary to test attempting to use the new policy with classic consumer =
