Hi Jiunn-Yang,
Thanks for your response.

AS1-AS6: lgtm

AS7: I'll have one last try at persuasion here, but I expect I won't succeed.=
 In KIP-1274, the default group protocol for KafkaConsumer is changing to "co=
nsumer". It is true that "classic" is still supported, but users will need to=
 explicitly enable it by setting "group.protocol=3Dclassic". I think this mea=
ns we could change the default for "auto.offset.reset" to "by_start_time" in =
AK 5.0. Whether we want to do it is a different matter.

AS8, AS9: lgtm

AS10: I'm not a fan of the "Epoch-ms" wording, particularly in the Admin API =
javadoc. I would just use "The creation time of the group." or similar.

AS11: I suspect you need to change StreamsGroupHeartbeatResponse too. Probabl=
y need a Kafka Streams expert to weigh in how `auto.offset.reset=3Dby_start_t=
ime` would work for the consumer in a streams group.

Thanks,
Andrew

