Hi all,

Thanks everyone for the votes.
I'm happy to announce that KIP-1200 is now accepted with
+3 binding (Chia-Pin Tsai, TengYao Chi, PoAn Yang) votes
and
+2 non-binding(Jiunn-Yang, Hsu Jhen-Yung)votes.

Best,
Kuan-Po

