Hi,
I would like to start the discussion on KIP-1313. This adds a unique client=
 instance ID to the request header of all Kafka protocol requests to give a=
 unique identifier which can be used to correlate the requests from each cl=
ient for the purposes of problem determination.

https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1313%3A+Client+instan=
ce+ID+in+all+request+headers

Thanks,
Andrew

