hi,

If the goal is simply to collect the rebalance timing, using a broker-side pl=
ugin feels a bit overkill. Alternatively, could we just expose the assignment=
Timestamp via the DescribeGroupsResponse? With this new field, users could se=
t up a cron job or monitor to poll the timestamp periodically. While it might=
 not cover 100% of real-time event tracking use cases, it is much simpler and=
 poses a significantly lower risk to the server.

Best,
