Chia-Ping Tsai created KAFKA-20411:
--------------------------------------

             Summary: Move org.apache.kafka.common.utils.Utils to org.apache.kafka.common.utils.internals.Utils
                 Key: KAFKA-20411
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20411
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
            Reporter: Chia-Ping Tsai
            Assignee: Eric Chang


Although Utils is intended to be an internal class, a quick search on GitHub reveals that it is widely used by many external repositories. While moving it to an internals package is technically permissible, I believe the impact is significant enough that we should require a KIP to formally announce and discuss this change



