> Hello everyone,=20
>=20
> I would like to start a discussion on KIP-1282: Prevent data loss during pa=
rtition expansion for dynamically added partitions
> <https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/x/mIY8G>
>=20
> This proposal aims to introduce a new auto.offset.reset policy by_start_tim=
e, anchoring the=20
> offset reset to the consumer's startup timestamp rather than partition disc=
overy time, to prevent=20
> silent data loss during partition expansion.
>=20
