Matthias J. Sax created KAFKA-20414:
---------------------------------------

             Summary: StreamsPartitioner should pass in headers
                 Key: KAFKA-20414
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20414
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: New Feature
          Components: streams
