Hi,

We are now in code freeze.
I'll start moving all the non blocker issues still targeting 4.3.0 to
the next release.
If you open a new blocker for 4.3.0, or need to apply a commit to the
4.3 branch, please let notify me first.

Thanks,
Mickael

