> > I would like to start a discussion on KIP-1282: Prevent data loss durin=
g partition expansion for dynamically added partitions
> > <https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/x/mIY8G>
> >
> > This proposal aims to introduce a new auto.offset.reset policy by_start=
_time, anchoring the
> > offset reset to the consumer's startup timestamp rather than partition =
discovery time, to prevent
> > silent data loss during partition expansion.
> >
> > Best regards,
> > Jiunn-Yang

