hi Mickael

I've opened KAFKA-20426 to track the busy loop issue in AsyncConsumer. I'm
currently waiting for feedback from Kirk True and Lianet Magrans.

Since this also occurs in previous releases, I don't believe it's a blocker
for now.  That said, the fix is straightforward, so I'd like to backport it
to 4.3 if we can get it in before the release is finalized.

Best,
Chia-Ping


