David Jacot created KAFKA-20431:
-----------------------------------

             Summary: ConsumerGroupDescribe API does not return partitions being revoked
                 Key: KAFKA-20431
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20431
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Bug
    Affects Versions: 4.1.2, 4.1.1, 4.2.0, 4.1.0, 4.0.1, 4.0.0, 4.3.0
            Reporter: David Jacot
            Assignee: David Jacot


The ConsumerGroupDescribe API does not return partitions that are being revoked from a member. This means the response does not reflect the complete set of partitions held by a member during a rebalance.



