Hello chia,

Thanks for your suggestions,

I have added following changes for kafka-consumer-groups.sh
* --describe --state gains a GROUP-CREATION-TIME column displaying=20
the group creation timestamp in ISO-8601 UTC format.

* --reset-offsets gains a new --by-start-time option that uses the group=20=

creation timestamp as the reference point for ListOffsets.

Best Regards
Jiunn-Yang

