Apologies in advance for my non-native English =E2=80=94 please bear =
with me :)

Thanks for the clarification on AS13. After thinking it through, I agree =
that=20
to_start_time is a better name than by_start_time. Your reasoning is =
convincing:=20
by_duration computes a relative time (now - duration), while the new =
policy=20
anchors to an absolute, server-recorded timestamp (the group creation =
time).=20
The to_* prefix correctly conveys =E2=80=9Cseek to a fixed point=E2=80=9D.=


