Content-Type: text/plain; charset="UTF-8"

Hi all,
I'd like to bring attention to a behavior change related to deprecated
configurations in the KRaft metadata log. Starting after 4.0, configs
deprecated in KIP-724 will be automatically removed from the metadata log.
See KAFKA-19851 <https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-19851> for
details. I updated the original KIP-724 to refect that change.

Thanks,
Tony

--000000000000181b57064f6f44bf--

