> describeConsumerGroups()
> / describeStreamsGroups() to fetch the group creation timestamp,
> ListOffsets to resolve offsets,
> and alterConsumerGroupOffsets() / alterStreamsGroupOffsets() to commit
> offsets. None of these
> operations go through the consumer protocol directly. So in my opinion, i=
t
