Hi everyone,

I'd like to start a vote on KIP-1306: Extend ConsumerRebalanceListener with C=
onsumer-aware methods. Popular frameworks rework the rebalance listener by p=
assing the full consumer reference into callback methods to support bookkeep=
ing ops like commit, seek. This KIP introduces 3 new default methods in Cons=
umerRebalanceListener to achieve this. It deprecates existing subscribe() me=
thods on Consumer that take a rebalance listener arg and introduces a new se=
tConsumerRebalanceListener method going forward.=20

