Hi Kafka Community,

I'm bumping this thread because I just need one more binding vote to bring
KIP-1154
<https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=3D3479332=
82> to
closure. This will enable us to achieve microsecond and nanosecond
precision in Kafka Connect.

Could someone please take a look, share feedback, or cast a vote?

Thanks,

Pritam

