             Summary: KIP-892: Add KIP-892 configuration to StreamsConfig
                 Key: KAFKA-20477
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20477
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Sub-task
            Reporter: Bill Bejeck


Add new configuration options for KIP-892.

StreamsConfig.java:
- statestore.uncommitted.max.bytes (default: 64MB, -1 to disable) =E2=80=94=
 memory threshold for early commit
- default.state.isolation.level (READ_UNCOMMITTED | READ_COMMITTED) =E2=80=
=94 controls buffering and IQ visibility
- Default for ALOS: READ_UNCOMMITTED (backward compat). Default for EOS: RE=
AD_COMMITTED

TopologyConfig.java =E2=80=94 propagate isolation level
StreamsConfigUtils.java =E2=80=94 config utilities



