Chia-Ping Tsai created KAFKA-20486:
--------------------------------------

             Summary: Include broker static configurations in BrokerRegistrationRequest
                 Key: KAFKA-20486
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20486
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Task
            Reporter: Chia-Ping Tsai
            Assignee: TaiJuWu


Currently, the KRaft Controller is unaware of the static configurations used by brokers at startup. This lack of visibility limits the Controller's ability to perform comprehensive, cluster-wide validation and sanity checks.



