hi Kuan-Po

To me, the simplest fix for now is to strictly redefine the behavior of
listConfigResources so that it only returns resource names that actually
have custom configs. This makes the DESCRIBE_CONFIGS requirement logically
sound. In short, I'm not strictly bound to pushing for the DESCRIBE
permission, as long as the API's behavior aligns with the permission
semantics

