Nicholas Telford created KAFKA-20489:
----------------------------------------

             Summary: Add config to control state wipe behaviour
                 Key: KAFKA-20489
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20489
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Sub-task
            Reporter: Nicholas Telford
            Assignee: Nicholas Telford


As per the KIP, we add our {{enable.transactional.statestore}} config, and use it to control whether we wipe state on-error under EOS.

This essentially gates our new Transactional StateStore implementation behind a feature flag, even if the implementation hasn't landed yet.



