Nicholas Telford created KAFKA-20490:
----------------------------------------

             Summary: Generic transaction buffer framework
                 Key: KAFKA-20490
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20490
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Sub-task
            Reporter: Nicholas Telford
            Assignee: Nicholas Telford


Our transaction buffers will use a two-layer buffer:=C2=A0 a "read buffer",=
 to service all reads, and an implementation dependent "write buffer", to o=
ptimize uncommitted writes.

Since the "read buffer" implementation will be shared between {{RocksDBStor=
e}} and {{InMemoryKeyValueStore}} etc. we will provide a generic implementa=
tion the new {{TransactionBuffer}} interface.



