----------------------------------------

             Summary: Transactional support for InMemoryKeyValueStore
                 Key: KAFKA-20494
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20494
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Sub-task
            Reporter: Nicholas Telford
            Assignee: Nicholas Telford


