Nicholas Telford created KAFKA-20497:
----------------------------------------

             Summary: ReadOnlyView implementations for wrapping stores
                 Key: KAFKA-20497
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20497
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Sub-task
            Reporter: Nicholas Telford
            Assignee: Nicholas Telford


Each of the {{Caching*Store and}}=C2=A0{{Metered*Store}} =C2=A0implementati=
ons need to provide a custom {{ReadOnlyView}} store implementation that imp=
lements their domain logic (caching/metering) on a read-only version of the=
ir {{wrapped()}} store (via: {{wrapped().readOnly(isolationLevel).}}

{{{}ChangeLogging*Store{}}}s can simply delegate to {{{}wrapped().readOnly(=
isolationLevel){}}}, because read-only stores do not log any changes.



--
