tony tang created KAFKA-20513:
---------------------------------

             Summary: Add metrics to Kraft that measure the number of fetch timeouts and election timeouts
                 Key: KAFKA-20513
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20513
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
            Reporter: tony tang
            Assignee: tony tang


We want to monitor how often a leader loses leadership in kraft because of networking issues. Having some metrics for the number of fetch timeout expirations and leader election timeout expirations would help us monitor that.

We already log a message in those cases. We'd better have some metrics for that.



