K5.0 Thanks, Aditya On 20 Apr 2026, at 13:22, Andrew Schofield <schofielaj@a=
pache.org> wrote: Hi Kirk, Thanks for your feedback. 1. The clientInstanceId=
 is just a UUID. If client ID is non-null, it's a string and could be quite c=
