Several items in the Kafka configuration reference seem to include links to=
 other parts of the documentation that do not work.
 * One example is the {{ssl.principal.mapping.rules}} option ([https://kafk=
a.apache.org/42/configuration/broker-configs/#brokerconfigs_ssl.principal.m=
apping.rules)] that should link to [https://kafka.apache.org/42/security/au=
thorization-and-acls/] but instead links to=C2=A0 non-existent [https://kaf=
ka.apache.org/42/configuration/broker-configs/#security_authz]=C2=A0
 * Another example is [https://kafka.apache.org/42/configuration/topic-conf=
igs/#topicconfigs_delete.retention.ms]
 * [https://kafka.apache.org/42/configuration/topic-configs/#topicconfigs_m=
in.insync.replicas] has another broker link
 * And there are few more

=C2=A0



