ive.com>
wrote:

> Hi,
> I would like to start the discussion on KIP-1313. This adds a unique
> client instance ID to the request header of all Kafka protocol requests t=
o
> give a unique identifier which can be used to correlate the requests from
> each client for the purposes of problem determination.
>
>
> https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1313%3A+Client+inst=
ance+ID+in+all+request+headers
>
> Thanks,
> Andrew
>

