Subject: [ANNOUNCE] New committer: Sean Quah
To: Users <users@kafka.apache.org>, dev@kafka.apache.org
Content-Type: multipart/alternative; boundary="000000000000f194c606509dcbab"
From: Chia-Ping Tsai <chia7712@gmail.com>
